      "message": "BIP375: reject inputs with missing UTXO or redeem script\n\nThe reference validator hit an assert, and crashed, on an input with no\nUTXO, a PSBT_IN_OUTPUT_INDEX past the end of its non-witness UTXO, or a\nP2SH scriptPubKey without PSBT_IN_REDEEM_SCRIPT. Raise ValueError\ninstead and report it from validate_bip375_psbt as a failed check.",
